<title>USA: AT&amp;T Capital prices $3.057 bln lease-backed notes.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T Capital prices $3.057 bln lease-backed notes.</headline>
<dateline>MORRISTOWN, N.J. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>AT&amp;T Capital said on Wednesday that it has priced $3.057 billion of small-ticket lease-backed securities.</p>
<p>Capita Equipment Receivables Trust will issue the securities in Class A and B notes, AT&amp;T said.</p>
<p>Closing is expected October 15, the company said.</p>
</text>
